•amounts charged for certain litigation matters; and
•other unusual or non-recurring expenses, losses, charges or gains. During Fiscal 2023, Adjusted Net Income improved $112.6 million to $393.4 million. This increase was primarily driven by higher sales and increased gross margin rate. Refer to the section below entitled “Results of Operations” for further explanation.

